  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The in-game keyboard used for text entry for login (both username and password) are inconsistent with the functionality of the chatbox. In particular, the way capitalization works is inconsistent- on the login keyboard the capitalization key is treated like 'caps lock', while the chatbox treats the key as 'shift' for 1 click or 'caps lock' if you double click.\n\nThis means for people who just have 1 capitol letter in a row in their username need to hit 'caps', enter the 1 letter. and then hit 'caps' again, when the much quicker and simpler way of doing it would be brining its functionality in-line with the chatbox keyboard. This way, it'd be much less cumbersome for people to type in their username/password, while also bringing consistent functionality between all text-fields",
